@middle_csharp_HostAddress = http://localhost:5027

### Список всех событий
GET {{middle_csharp_HostAddress}}/events
Accept: application/json

### Создать событие
POST {{middle_csharp_HostAddress}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Meeting",
  "description": "Sprint planning",
  "startAt": "2025-01-10T10:00:00",
  "endAt": "2025-01-10T11:00:00"
}

### Событие по id (подставь id из ответа POST)
GET {{middle_csharp_HostAddress}}/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Обновить событие целиком
PUT {{middle_csharp_HostAddress}}/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Meeting (updated)",
  "description": "Sprint planning v2",
  "startAt": "2025-01-10T10:00:00",
  "endAt": "2025-01-10T12:00:00"
}

### Удалить событие
DELETE {{middle_csharp_HostAddress}}/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
